// The crucible furnace's iron frame (StainlessSteel, #796, README "Crucible furnace"; the rig's
// build.frame): the binding's straps and bands, the grate's bearers and firebars, the ash mouth's lintel
// and the damper's guides, of four iron rods and an iron plate, with a hammer: its 760 voxels of iron at
// the pack's one iron rate (128 voxels an ingot, a rod one, a plate two; CrucibleFurnace/tools/make_shape.py's
// frame_recipe measures it). Placed, it is the furnace's controller and ghosts; the brickwork, the lining
// and the lid go in afterwards, a stack a click. The server disables it with StainlessSteel off.
[
	{
		ingredientPattern: "RPR,RHR",
		width: 3,
		height: 2,
		ingredients: {
			"P": { type: "item", code: "game:metalplate-iron" },
			"R": { type: "item", code: "game:rod-iron" },
			"H": { type: "item", code: "game:hammer-*", isTool: true }
		},
		output: { type: "block", code: "seraphhorizons:cruciblefurnace-frame-north" }
	}
]
